{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790442877315,"sessionID":"ses_f214ebbbfffewSgu7CLg25Rikb","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_da9c0461b30e46bea294268a","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Explore project structure","prompt":"Thoroughly explore the project structure at /workspace. List all directories and files, especially focusing on:\n1. res://scenes/ directory and all .tscn and .gd files\n2. Any existing card-related scripts\n3. The main.tscn scene\n4. Any .tres or .gd resource files\n\nReturn a complete file listing with full paths and a summary of what each file appears to contain.","subagent_type":"explore"},"output":"<task id=\"ses_f214e675cffeypLt5Id4QkC62O\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\nI have now read every important file in the project. Here is the complete analysis:\n\n---\n\n## Complete Project Structure and File Summary for `/workspace`\n\n### PROJECT OVERVIEW\n\nThis is a **Godot 4.2** project named **\"Card Dragging Task\"** -- a card-based combat game heavily inspired by *Slay the Spire*. The main entry scene is `res://scenes/main.tscn`, and the game operates at a native resolution of 256x144 pixels (upscaled 5x to 1280x720). The project has two separate \"harnesses\":\n1. **`scenes/main.tscn`** -- A simpler test harness for the card dragging mechanic (with three placeholder cards: \"Charge\", \"Brace\", \"Slice\")\n2. **`scenes/battle/battle.tscn`** -- The full battle scene with enemies, a player, mana, and all mechanics\n\n---\n\n### ROOT-LEVEL FILES\n\n| File | Description |\n|---|---|\n| `/workspace/project.godot` | Project config: name=\"Card Dragging Task\", main scene, viewport 256x144, mobile renderer, input maps for left/right mouse, physics layers for card_target_selector (1) and card_drop_area (2) |\n| `/workspace/task_config.json` | Instructions for implementing the card dragging mechanic across `card_state_machine.gd`, `card_ui.gd`, the five state scripts, and `hand.gd` |\n| `/workspace/default_bus_layout.tres` | AudioBusLayout resource: defines \"SFX\" bus and \"Music\" bus with volume levels |\n| `/workspace/main_theme.tres` | Theme resource: sets pixel_rpg.ttf font at size 6, defines Button styles (normal/hover/disabled/pressed/focus) and Panel/PanelContainer styles using card styleboxes |\n| `/workspace/icon.png` / `icon.png.import` | Application icon |\n| `/workspace/LICENSE` | License file |\n\n---\n\n### `res://scenes/` DIRECTORY (ALL .tscn AND .gd FILES)\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/main.tscn` (33 lines)\nThe **simpler card-dragging test harness**. Contains:\n- **Node2D \"Main\"** with `main.gd` script\n- **Area2D \"ReleaseZone\"** (collision_layer=2) with a 268x90 collision shape -- the card drop area\n- **CanvasLayer \"ArenaUI\"** with a **HBoxContainer \"Palm\"** (anchored bottom-center) running `hand.gd` -- holds card UI instances\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/main.gd` (9 lines)\nThe **test harness script**. On `_ready()`:\n- References `$ArenaUI/Palm` as the hand\n- Adds three cards by title: \"Charge\", \"Brace\", \"Slice\" via `hand.add_card()`\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/battle/battle.tscn` (131 lines)\nThe **full battle scene**. Contains:\n- **Node2D \"Battle\"** with `battle.gd`, `char_stats` from `warrior.tres`, background music\n- **Sprite2D \"Background\"** (darkened)\n- **Area2D \"CardDropArea\"** (collision_layer=2, 256x100)\n- **EnemyHandler** with 3 enemies: 2 Bats and 1 Crab\n- **Player** (at position 45,80)\n- **CardTargetSelector** instance\n- **PlayerHandler** linked to the hand\n- **CanvasLayer \"BattleUI\"** with: Hand (HBoxContainer), ManaUI, Tooltip, EndTurnButton\n- **CanvasLayer \"RedFlash\"** (for damage feedback)\n- **CanvasLayer \"BattleOverLayer\"** with BattleOverPanel\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/battle/battle.gd` (48 lines)\nThe **battle orchestrator**:\n- Creates a fresh `CharacterStats` instance from `char_stats` (so health/deck reset between battles)\n- Wires up event signals: enemy turn end -> player turn start, player turn end -> discard cards, player died -> game over\n- Starts the battle by resetting enemy actions and calling `player_handler.start_battle()`\n- On all enemies dead: emits victory\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_ui.tscn` (85 lines)\nThe **card widget scene**:\n- **Control \"CardUI\"** (25x30 minimum) with `card_ui.gd`\n- **Panel** child -- background visuals\n- **Label \"Title\"** -- shows card name (default \"Card\")\n- **Label \"State\"** -- shows current state name (default \"Idle\")\n- **Area2D \"DropPointDetector\"** (collision_mask=2, shape 25x30) -- detects drop areas\n- **Node \"CardStateMachine\"** with initial_state = CardBaseState and four child states:\n  - CardBaseState (state=0 -- `card_base_state.gd`)\n  - CardClickedState (state=1 -- `card_clicked_state.gd`)\n  - CardDraggingState (state=2 -- `card_dragging_state.gd`)\n  - CardReleasedState (state=3 -- `card_released_state.gd`)\n- Signal connections: `gui_input`, `mouse_entered`, `mouse_exited`, `area_entered`/`area_exited` from DropPointDetector\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_ui.gd` (61 lines)\nThe **CardUI class** (extends Control):\n- Exports `card_title` with setter that updates the Title label\n- References: `$Panel`, `$Title`, `$State`, `$DropPointDetector`, `$CardStateMachine`\n- Properties: `targets: Array[Node]`, `original_index`, `home_parent`, `tween`\n- Methods: `animate_to_position()` (tween to position), `play()` (queue_free -- plays the card)\n- Signal: `reparent_requested(which_card_ui)`\n- **Input callbacks `_on_gui_input`, `_on_mouse_entered`, `_on_mouse_exited`, `_on_drop_point_detector_area_entered`, `_on_drop_point_detector_area_exited` are all currently EMPTY stubs**\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_state_machine.gd` (32 lines)\nThe **state machine** (extends Node):\n- Exports `initial_state: Node`\n- Has `current_state` and `states: Dictionary`\n- `init(card_ui)` -- iterates children, stores them by `state` enum, sets `card_ui` reference\n- **Transition and input forwarding methods (`_on_transition_requested`, `on_input`, `on_gui_input`, `on_mouse_entered`, `on_mouse_exited`) are all EMPTY stubs**\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_state.gd` (33 lines)\nThe **abstract base state** (extends Node):\n- Enum `State {BASE=0, CLICKED=1, DRAGGING=2, RELEASED=3}`\n- Signal: `transition_requested(from, to)`\n- Exports `state: State` (default BASE)\n- Property: `card_ui`\n- **All methods (`enter`, `exit`, `on_input`, `on_gui_input`, `on_mouse_entered`, `on_mouse_exited`) are empty stubs**\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_base_state.gd` (1 line)\nExtends `card_state.gd` -- empty override with behavior expected to be: emit `reparent_requested`, reset `DropPointDetector.monitoring=false`, transition to CLICKED on left-click\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_clicked_state.gd` (1 line)\nExtends `card_state.gd` -- empty override with behavior expected to be: record `original_index`, enable `DropPointDetector.monitoring=true`, transition to DRAGGING on mouse motion\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_dragging_state.gd` (3 lines)\nExtends `card_state.gd` with `const DRAG_MINIMUM_THRESHOLD = 0.045`. Behavior expected: reparent card to `screen_layer` group node, follow mouse, cancel to BASE on right-click, release to RELEASED after threshold elapsed\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_released_state.gd` (1 line)\nExtends `card_state.gd` -- empty override with behavior expected to be: immediately remove card when `targets` not empty, otherwise return to BASE on next input\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_aiming_state.gd` (27 lines)\n**The one fully implemented card state!** Used in the battle scene for single-target card aiming:\n- `enter()`: clears targets, animates card to center-top of parent, disables DropPointDetector monitoring, emits `card_aim_started`\n- `exit()`: emits `card_aim_ended`\n- `on_input()`: if mouse moves below Y threshold (138) or right-click -> back to BASE; if left mouse released/pressed -> RELEASED\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_base_stylebox.tres`\nStyleBoxFlat: brown background (0.63, 0.35, 0.32), 1px gray border\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_drag_stylebox.tres`\nStyleBoxFlat: same brown background, 1px gold border, 2px gold shadow (for dragging state)\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_hover_stylebox.tres`\nStyleBoxFlat: same brown background, 1px gold border (for hover state)\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/card_target_selector/card_target_selector.tscn` (26 lines)\nNode2D with a small Area2D (4x4, collision_mask=4 for enemies), a CanvasLayer, and a CardArc (Line2D) child\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/card_target_selector/card_target_selector.gd` (78 lines)\nHandles the **card aiming arc** for single-target cards:\n- Listens to `card_aim_started`/`card_aim_ended`\n- During aiming, draws 8-point cubic ease-out arc from card to mouse, moves Area2D to mouse position\n- Tracks targets via `area_entered`/`area_exited` signals on the collision area\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/card_target_selector/card_arc.tscn` (10 lines)\nLine2D node with width 4 and a 3-point width curve (0.2 min, easing to 1.0 mid, back to 0.2)\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/player/player.tscn` (15 lines)\nNode2D with `player.gd`, a Sprite2D, and a StatsUI child\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/player/player.gd` (53 lines)\nThe **Player class** (extends Node2D):\n- `set_character_stats()`: assigns stats, connects to `stats_changed` signal\n- `update_player()`: sets sprite texture from stats.art, refreshes stats UI\n- `take_damage()`: applies white flash material, shakes via `Shaker.shake()`, calls `stats.take_damage()`, emits `player_died` and `queue_free()` if health <= 0\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/player/player_handler.gd` (76 lines)\nManages the **player's card system**:\n- `start_battle()`: duplicates deck into draw_pile, shuffles, creates empty discard pile\n- `start_turn()`: resets block, resets mana, draws `cards_per_turn` cards\n- `end_turn()`: disables hand, discards all cards\n- `draw_card()`: reshuffles from discard if needed, adds card from draw_pile to hand\n- `discard_cards()`: tweens discarding each card with an interval\n- `reshuffle_deck_from_discard()`: moves all discarded cards back to draw_pile and shuffles\n- `_on_card_played()`: adds played card to discard pile\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/enemy/enemy.tscn` (36 lines)\nArea2D \"Enemy\" (groups=[\"enemies\"], collision_layer=4) with Sprite2D, Arrow sprite, CollisionShape2D, StatsUI, IntentUI\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/enemy/enemy.gd` (107 lines)\nThe **Enemy class** (extends Area2D):\n- `set_enemy_stats()`: creates instance, connects signals\n- `setup_ai()`: instantiates AI scene as `EnemyActionPicker` child\n- `update_action()`: gets next action (first conditional or chance-based)\n- `do_turn()`: resets block, performs `current_action`\n- `take_damage()`: white flash + shake, tween chain -> take damage -> queue_free if dead\n- Arrow shows/hides on area enter/exit\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/enemy/enemy_handler.gd` (29 lines)\nProcesses enemies in order:\n- `reset_enemy_actions()`: clears and re-rolls all enemy actions\n- `start_turn()`: first enemy performs its turn\n- `_on_enemy_action_completed()`: chains to next enemy; if last, emits `enemy_turn_ended`\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/enemy/enemy_action.gd` (22 lines)\nAbstract **EnemyAction** (extends Node):\n- Enum: `CONDITIONAL`, `CHANCE_BASED`\n- Properties: `intent`, `sound`, `type`, `chance_weight`, `accumulated_weight`, `enemy`, `target`\n- `is_performable()` returns false (override for conditional actions)\n- `perform_action()` is empty stub\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/enemy/enemy_action_picker.gd` (67 lines)\n**EnemyActionPicker** (extends Node):\n- `_ready()`: finds target (player group), calls `setup_chances()`\n- `get_action()`: returns first conditional action or chance-based action\n- `get_chance_based_action()`: weighted random selection\n- `setup_chances()`: computes accumulated weights\n\n#### `/workspace/scenes/enemy/enemy_action_picker.tscn` (6 lines)\nEmpty Node with `enemy_action_picker.gd` script -- base template for AI scenes\n\n---\n\n### UI SCENES AND SCRIPTS (`/workspace/scenes/ui/`)\n\n| File | Description |\n|---|---|\n| `/workspace/scenes/ui/battle_ui.gd` | **BattleUI** (CanvasLayer): holds Hand, ManaUI, EndTurnButton; connects card-drawn to enable button, end-turn button emits `player_turn_ended` |\n| `/workspace/scenes/ui/hand.gd` | **Hand** (HBoxContainer): `add_card()` instantiates `card_ui.tscn`, adds as child, sets `home_parent` and `card_title` |\n| `/workspace/scenes/ui/stats_ui.tscn` | HBoxContainer with Block icon+label and Health icon+label |\n| `/workspace/scenes/ui/stats_ui.gd` | **StatsUI**: `update_stats()` displays block and health values, hides block when 0, hides health when 0 |\n| `/workspace/scenes/ui/mana_ui.tscn` | Panel with ManaLabel showing \"3/3\" |\n| `/workspace/scenes/ui/mana_ui.gd` | **ManaUI**: connects to `char_stats.stats_changed`, displays \"mana/max_mana\" |\n| `/workspace/scenes/ui/tooltip.tscn` | PanelContainer with icon (TextureRect) and text (RichTextLabel) |\n| `/workspace/scenes/ui/tooltip.gd` | **Tooltip**: Shows on `card_tooltip_requested`, hides on `tooltip_hide_requested`; fades in/out with tween |\n| `/workspace/scenes/ui/intent_ui.tscn` | HBoxContainer with Icon (14x14) and Number label |\n| `/workspace/scenes/ui/intent_ui.gd` | **IntentUI**: `update_intent()` sets icon texture and number text, hides when intent is null |\n| `/workspace/scenes/ui/battle_over_panel.tscn` | Full-screen Panel with \"Victorious!\" label, Continue button (quits), Restart button (reloads) |\n| `/workspace/scenes/ui/battle_over_panel.gd` | **BattleOverPanel**: `show_screen()` shows WIN or LOSE variant, pauses tree on display |\n| `/workspace/scenes/ui/red_flash.gd` | **RedFlash** (CanvasLayer): Flashes red overlay for 0.1s when player is hit |\n\n---\n\n### `res://custom_resources/` -- RESOURCE SCRIPTS\n\n| File | Description |\n|---|---|\n| `/workspace/custom_resources/stats.gd` | **Stats** (extends Resource): `max_health`, `art` texture, computed `health` and `block` with setters/clamping, `take_damage()` subtracts block first, `heal()`, `create_instance()` for duplication |\n| `/workspace/custom_resources/character_stats.gd` | **CharacterStats** (extends Stats): adds `starting_deck`, `cards_per_turn`, `max_mana`, `mana`; `reset_mana()`, `can_play_card()`, `create_instance()` duplicates deck too |\n| `/workspace/custom_resources/enemy_stats.gd` | **EnemyStats** (extends Stats): adds `ai: PackedScene` |\n| `/workspace/custom_resources/card.gd` | **Card** (extends Resource): enum `Type {ATTACK, SKILL, POWER}`, enum `Target {SELF, SINGLE_ENEMY, ALL_ENEMIES, EVERYONE}`, properties `id`, `type`, `target`, `cost`, `icon`, `tooltip_text`, `sound`. `is_single_targeted()`, `_get_targets()` resolves by group, `play()` deducts mana and calls `apply_effects()`. `apply_effects()` is empty (override in subclasses) |\n| `/workspace/custom_resources/card_pile.gd` | **CardPile** (extends Resource): array of Cards, `draw_card()` pops front, `add_card()`, `shuffle()`, `clear()`, signal `card_pile_size_changed` |\n| `/workspace/custom_resources/effect.gd` | **Effect** (extends RefCounted): `sound` property, empty `execute()` method |\n| `/workspace/custom_resources/intent.gd` | **Intent** (extends Resource): `number` string, `icon` texture |\n\n---\n\n### CARD SCRIPTS AND RESOURCE FILES\n\n| File | Description |\n|---|---|\n| `/workspace/characters/warrior/cards/warrior_slash.tres` | Card resource: id=\"warrior_slash\", type=ATTACK(0), target=ALL_ENEMIES(2), cost=2, deals 4 damage to all enemies, uses `slash.ogg` |\n| `/workspace/characters/warrior/cards/warrior_slash.gd` | Extends Card: `apply_effects()` creates DamageEffect(amount=4) with slash sound |\n| `/workspace/characters/warrior/cards/warrior_block.tres` | Card resource: id=\"warrior_block\", type=SKILL(1), target=SELF(0), cost=1, gains 5 block, uses `block.ogg` |\n| `/workspace/characters/warrior/cards/warrior_block.gd` | Extends Card: `apply_effects()` creates BlockEffect(amount=5) with block sound |\n| `/workspace/characters/warrior/cards/warrior_axe_attack.tres` | Card resource: id=\"warrior_axe_attack\", type=ATTACK(0), target=SINGLE_ENEMY(1), cost=1, deals 6 damage, uses `axe.ogg` |\n| `/workspace/characters/warrior/cards/warrior_axe_attack.gd` | Extends Card: `apply_effects()` creates DamageEffect(amount=6) with axe sound |\n\n---\n\n### CHARACTER AND ENEMY .TRES FILES\n\n| File | Description |\n|---|---|\n| `/workspace/characters/warrior/warrior.tres` | **CharacterStats** resource: max_health=35, max_mana=3, cards_per_turn=4, starting_deck (10 cards: 4x Axe Attack, 2x Slash, 4x Block), art=tile_0087 |\n| `/workspace/characters/warrior/warrior_starting_deck.tres` | **CardPile** resource: 10 cards in a specific order for the warrior's starting deck |\n| `/workspace/enemies/bat/bat_enemy.tres` | **EnemyStats**: max_health=8, ai scene=bat_enemy_ai.tscn, art=tile_0120 |\n| `/workspace/enemies/bat/bat_enemy_ai.tscn` | **EnemyActionPicker** \"BatEnemyAI\": BatAttackAction (chance_weight=3.0, damage=4 x2 hits, intent: \"2x4\"), BatBlockAction (chance_weight=1.0, block=4) |\n| `/workspace/enemies/bat/bat_attack_action.gd` | Extends EnemyAction: dashes to target, deals 4 damage twice with tween, emits `enemy_action_completed` |\n| `/workspace/enemies/bat/bat_block_action.gd` | Extends EnemyAction: applies 4 block to self, waits 0.6s, emits done |\n| `/workspace/enemies/crab/crab_enemy.tres` | **EnemyStats**: max_health=10, ai scene=crab_enemy_ai.tscn, art=tile_0110 |\n| `/workspace/enemies/crab/crab_enemy_ai.tscn` | **EnemyActionPicker** \"CrabEnemyAI\": AttackAction (chance_weight=1.0, damage=7), BlockAction (chance_weight=1.0, block=6), MegaBlockAction (type=CONDITIONAL, block=15, hp_threshold=6) |\n| `/workspace/enemies/crab/crab_attack_action.gd` | Dashes to target, deals 7 damage once, returns to start, emits done |\n| `/workspace/enemies/crab/crab_block_action.gd` | Applies 6 block to self, waits 0.6s, emits done |\n| `/workspace/enemies/crab/crab_mega_block_action.gd` | Conditional action: triggers once when health <= 6, applies 15 block |\n\n---\n\n### EFFECTS SCRIPTS\n\n| File | Description |\n|---|---|\n| `/workspace/effects/damage_effect.gd` | **DamageEffect** (extends Effect): `amount` property, `execute()` calls `take_damage()` on targets that are Enemy or Player, plays sound via SFXPlayer |\n| `/workspace/effects/block_effect.gd` | **BlockEffect** (extends Effect): `amount` property, `execute()` adds block to target stats, plays sound via SFXPlayer |\n\n---\n\n### GLOBAL AUTOLOAD SCRIPTS\n\n| File | Description |\n|---|---|\n| `/workspace/global/events.gd` | **Events singleton**: Signals for card_drag_started/ended, card_aim_started/ended, card_played, card_tooltip_requested, tooltip_hide_requested, player_hand_drawn/discarded, player_turn_ended, player_hit, player_died, enemy_action_completed, enemy_turn_ended, battle_over_screen_requested |\n| `/workspace/global/shaker.gd` | **Shaker**: `shake()` creates 10-step tween that oscillates position with decreasing strength, resets to original position |\n| `/workspace/global/sound_player.gd` | **SoundPlayer**: `play()` routes audio to first available idle AudioStreamPlayer child; `stop()` stops all |\n| `/workspace/global/music_player.tscn` | MusicPlayer node with 4 AudioStreamPlayer children on \"Music\" bus |\n| `/workspace/global/sfx_player.tscn` | SFXPlayer node with 8 AudioStreamPlayer children on \"SFX\" bus |\n\n---\n\n### ART ASSETS (`/workspace/art/`)\n\n- **Audio**: `8_bit_iced_village_lofi.mp3` (background music), `axe.ogg`, `block.ogg`, `enemy_attack.ogg`, `enemy_block.ogg`, `slash.ogg`\n- **Sprites**: `background.png`, `heart.png`, `player_heart.png`, `arrow.png`\n- **Tiles**: 47 tile PNGs (`tile_0074.png` through `tile_0131.png`) -- pixel-art RPG tileset pieces\n- **Font**: `pixel_rpg.ttf` (6px default font)\n- **Shader**: `white_sprite_material.gdshader` -- turns sprite solid white (used for damage flash effect)\n- **Material**: `white_sprite_material.tres` -- ShaderMaterial referencing the shader\n\n---\n\n### SCRIPT TEMPLATES\n\n| File | Description |\n|---|---|\n| `/workspace/script_templates/Node/card_template.gd` | Godot script template for creating new Card logic scripts |\n| `/workspace/script_templates/Node/effect_template.gd` | Godot script template for creating new Effect scripts |\n| `/workspace/script_templates/Node/enemy_action_template.gd` | Godot script template for creating new EnemyAction scripts |\n\n---\n\n### SUMMARY OF CARD-RELATED FILES (the focus area)\n\nThe card dragging mechanic involves these key files, most of which are **currently incomplete/empty**:\n\n1. **`/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_ui.tscn`** -- Scene structure is complete with all nodes and state machine children set up\n2. **`/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_ui.gd`** -- Properties and method signatures exist, but all input/event handlers are empty stubs\n3. **`/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_state_machine.gd`** -- `init()` is complete, but `_on_transition_requested`, `on_input`, `on_gui_input`, `on_mouse_entered`, `on_mouse_exited` are empty\n4. **`/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_state.gd`** -- Base class with enum and signal, all methods are empty\n5. **`/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_base_state.gd`** -- Empty (needs: reparent_requested signal emit, reset monitoring, transition to CLICKED)\n6. **`/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_clicked_state.gd`** -- Empty (needs: record index, enable monitoring, transition to DRAGGING)\n7. **`/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_dragging_state.gd`** -- Has `DRAG_MINIMUM_THRESHOLD` constant (needs: reparent to screen_layer, follow mouse, threshold check, cancel/confirm)\n8. **`/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_released_state.gd`** -- Empty (needs: remove card if targets exist, else return to BASE)\n9. **`/workspace/scenes/card_ui/card_states/card_aiming_state.gd`** -- **Fully implemented** (only state that is complete)\n10. **`/workspace/scenes/ui/hand.gd`** -- Needs `reparent_requested` signal connection for drag-cancel restoration\n11. **`/workspace/scenes/main.tscn`** and **`/workspace/scenes/main.gd`** -- The test harness, ready to use for testing the card drag mechanic\n12. **`/workspace/task_config.json`** -- The full specification for what needs to be implemented\n\n### KEY ARCHITECTURAL PATTERNS\n\n- **Cards are Resources**, not Nodes. `Card` is a Resource subclass; individual cards (warrior_slash, warrior_block, etc.) are `.tres` files with attached `.gd` scripts that override `apply_effects()`.\n- **CardUI is the visual node** that wraps a Card resource for display and interaction in the hand.\n- **State pattern** via `CardStateMachine` + individual state nodes (BASE, CLICKED, DRAGGING, RELEASED, AIMING).\n- **Two collision layers**: Layer 1 = card_target_selector (for enemy targeting), Layer 2 = card_drop_area (for release zone detection).\n- **Events singleton** for decoupled communication between systems.\n- **Signal chain** for turn flow: player_turn_ended -> hand discarded -> enemy turn starts -> enemies act in order -> enemy_turn_ended -> player turn starts.\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_f214ebbbfffewSgu7CLg25Rikb","sessionId":"ses_f214e675cffeypLt5Id4QkC62O","model":{"modelID":"deepseek-v4-pro","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Explore project structure","time":{"start":1790442576039,"end":1790442877299}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_807d8cda-9825-48fe-87f7-894720e3788a"}},"id":"prt_0deb1989c00109CkSRU0O7Gv9l","sessionID":"ses_f214ebbbfffewSgu7CLg25Rikb","messageID":"msg_0deb146220014TGRF08bCu73JI"}}
